lemma[fact] L38:natural-reading-initials-ruth-notebook-she-intended-ask "On the natural reading of the initials in Ruth's notebook, she intended to ask Beatrice Orr about the fibers before telling Aldous Bell, but the note alone does not establish what either person already knew."
  <- AND#J38(P3, P16, P49, P133)

lemma[fact] L39:beatrice-earlier-restoration-explanation-could-account-modern-fibers "Beatrice's earlier-restoration explanation could account for modern fibers without forgery, but it is currently testimony rather than independent proof and does not negate the need to examine the Psalter."
