lemma[fact] L45:payments-defunct-firm-without-corresponding-acquisitions-authorized "Payments to a defunct firm without corresponding acquisitions, authorized by repeated stamp impressions and withdrawn through bearer drafts, strongly support Escrow 17 being a vehicle for concealed or sham transactions, although the ultimate recipient is not yet identified."
