lemma[fact] L46:gideon-now-leading-identified-suspect-ruth-death-because "Gideon is now the leading identified suspect in Ruth's death because he was a male known to use the likely summons typewriter and the only non-victim then shown to know the account number Ruth's opponent apparently referenced; this is strong circumstantial evidence, not a voice identification or proof of exclusive knowledge."
  <- AND#J47(P7, P124, P125, P126, P166, L29, L30, L44)

lemma[fact] L47:gideon-administered-suspicious-escrow-17-account-knew-aldous "Gideon administered the suspicious Escrow 17 account and knew Aldous had demanded its vouchers and intended to expose discrepancies, giving Gideon a strong apparent motive to silence Aldous; Gideon's explanation and the bearer drafts leave the ultimate fraud beneficiary formally unresolved."
