lemma[fact] L48:gideon-established-billiard-room-alibi-prevents-his-personal "Gideon's established billiard-room alibi prevents his personal presence at the probable 9:40 collapse but does not exclude him from preparing and sending the earlier-delivered mechanical parcel."
