lemma[fact] L49:missing-statement-matching-burned-fragment-aldous-note-that "The missing statement, matching burned fragment, and Aldous's note that it arrived already scorched support attempted destruction of Escrow 17 evidence before dinner; Gideon's overturned-candle explanation remains possible only as uncorroborated testimony."
