lemma[fact] L51:felix-access-office-stamp-typewriter-does-not-establish "Felix's access to the office stamp and typewriter does not establish knowledge of Escrow 17: it lay outside his ordinary bookkeeping, named only Aldous and Gideon, and its statements travelled sealed through Gideon."
